title: 'Assignment Defender — AI-Proofing Assistant'
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-19
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: https://github.com/DTC-Consortium/DTC-Consortium-MLU
url: https://github.com/DTC-Consortium/DTC-Consortium-MLU/tree/main/mlu/ml-ai-applications/mlu-000010-assignment-defender
abstract: >-
  A published Amazon Quick app that reads an assignment's goals, instructions, and rubric,
  then estimates how well generative AI could satisfy it on its own. Faculty set the
  maximum grade they think an AI-only submission should earn, and the app returns an AI
  Robustness Score, a SWOT analysis, and three redesign options at increasing strength.
  The goal is not to block AI but to find where it substitutes for the skill actually
  being assessed. No account or coding needed to use it.
authors:
